# Project Guidelines

- Never use pill badges, next-gen labels, or decorative tags (such as `inline-flex items-center gap-2 ... rounded-full`) with Sparkles/icons at the top of landing page sections, hero sections, feature pages, or anywhere else in the project. This is considered AI slop. Ensure this type of div is never used anytime anywhere.
- Never use floating micro-widgets (such as absolute positioned glass divs with `absolute -bottom-6 -left-6` or `-right-6` showing status or metadata like "Active Workspace Operations Board", "Workspace Authority", etc.) next to the main hero screenshots in the feature pages. Keep the screenshot/graphic presentations clean.
